      'Chilès J.-P., Delfiner P. (2012). Geostatistics: Modeling Spatial Uncertainty. 2nd edition, Wiley.',
      'Diggle P. J., Ribeiro P. J. Jr. (2007). Model-based Geostatistics. Springer.',
